			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120210804,
					"content": "其實最早的時候，海祇島的神社並非在珊瑚宮，而是在別的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210805,
					"content": "那裡靠近海祇島的七天神像，當時的海祇島雖不像幕府那般尊崇將軍，但也認可她的存在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210806,
					"content": "但隨著那一刀落下，守護我們海祇島的魔神被斬斷之後，當初的神社便廢棄了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210807,
					"content": "也從那時起，海祇島和幕府的關係就變得有些微妙，彼此之間的成見愈來愈深。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210808,
					"content": "這次和談，我本來也想好好跟天領奉行討論一下這個問題。有些恩怨，總有一天要放下的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210809,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人，今天怎麼有空來這邊看看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "用高"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210810,
					"content": "總覺得妳的氣色比上次差了，平時要照顧好自己，妳可是我們最大的依靠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "用高"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210811,
					"content": "嗯嗯，請放心，沒事的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210812,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人，聽我一句勸告。我們跟幕府軍打了那麼久，不能說談就談啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "結菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210813,
					"content": "要是與他們和解的話，當初守護我們的魔神不就枉死了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "結菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210814,
					"content": "好了好了，都什麼年代啦。才剛打完仗呢，安安穩穩地過日子多好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "用高"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210815,
					"content": "我當然知道，只是…唉。至少態度要強硬一些，不能隨便妥協。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "結菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210816,
					"content": "我明白的，此事我會再考慮一下，一定會妥善處理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210817,
					"content": "太好了…那就麻煩珊瑚宮大人了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "結菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210818,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人！哎呀呀，沒想到能在這裡見到您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志織"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210819,
					"content": "我的女兒，今年報名參加巫女選拔了。要是她能進珊瑚宮就好啦，珊瑚宮大人心善，一定不會虧待她。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志織"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210820,
					"content": "唉，我常和我家女兒說，讓她有機會的話跟珊瑚宮大人好好學學。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志織"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210821,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人這麼年輕，就已經會待人處事，人又聰明伶俐…我家女兒，一直把珊瑚宮大人當作榜樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志織"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210822,
					"content": "如果她能來珊瑚宮的話，我會關照一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210823,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人！總算見到您了。關於今年農業減產的問題，我想向您報告一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岩田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210824,
					"content": "#珊瑚宮大人，這位不是劍魚二番隊的隊長嗎？{F#她}{M#他}以後會留在海祇島嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亮子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210825,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "幸也"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210826,
					"content": "呼…大家稍微靜一下，我都會聽的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210827,
					"content": "不過，比較長的問題還是建議寫成報告，遞到珊瑚宮。有時間我會慢慢批覆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210828,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210829,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}還好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210830,
						120210832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210830,
					"content": "還好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210831
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120210831,
					"content": "#呵呵…看來{F#妳}{M#你}很擅長應對這樣的場合。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210834,
					"content": "珊瑚宮大人，原來您在這裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210835,
					"content": "有件事要向您報告，我們有一批祭祀用具遲遲沒有送到，我擔心是被劫走了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210836,
					"content": "那些東西我已經找回來了，不必擔心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210837,
					"content": "真的嗎？不愧是珊瑚宮大人，太厲害了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210838,
					"content": "最近的公文我簡單地整理了一下，已經放在您的桌子上了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210839,
					"content": "另外，從時程看來，今天還有一場關於發展紡織業的會議…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210840,
					"content": "時程…現在？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210841,
					"content": "是的，那兩位遠道而來的姑娘已經在等您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210842,
					"content": "#好吧…{NICKNAME}，本來想帶{F#妳}{M#你}好好逛一逛海祇島，看來要忙完再一起散散心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210843,
					"content": "明天我們在珊瑚宮門口碰面吧，然後一起去籌備慶功宴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210844,
					"content": "慶功宴！會有很多好吃的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210845
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210845,
					"content": "#呵呵…當然有的。有些海祇島的特色美食，也歡迎{F#妳}{M#你}們品嚐一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210846,
					"content": "好耶！那我們明天不見不散啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210847
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210847,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210832,
					"content": "有點累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210833
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120210833,
					"content": "是吧，我也感覺有點頭痛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				}
			]
